Package: simitall
Type: Package
Title: Integrated Genome, Sequencing, Population, and Breeding Simulation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Nirwan",
      family = "Tandukar",
      email = "tandukar.nirwan@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: An R-first interface for coordinated genome, genome annotation,
    sequencing-read, hybrid-assembly, genome-wide association study,
    phenotype, population-genetic, and breeding simulations. The package
    produces explicit truth sets and interoperable FASTA, FASTQ, VCF, GFF3,
    BED, TSV, and JSON outputs. External simulators and assemblers are
    orchestrated from R, while population evolution can be delegated to
    SimuPOP through 'reticulate'.
